  «type: X»
  «description: (PLECS) Pulse Geneator (2 Outputs)»
  «library file: |.subckt Pulse-Generator-2out out1 out2\nV1 out1 0 pulse Lo Hi remainder(Delay1,1/f) 1p 1p DutyCycle/f 1/f DC if(remainder(Delay1,1/f)<=0,Hi,Lo)\nV2 out2 0 pulse Lo Hi remainder(Delay2,1/f) 1p 1p DutyCycle/f 1/f DC if(remainder(Delay2,1/f)<=0,Hi,Lo)\n.func remainder(x,y)=x-y*round(x/y)\n.ends Pulse-Generator-2out»
